) 3alpha,7alpha,24(S)-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestanoyl-CoA\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10470878], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193732\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193732.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29370, \"displayName\": \"ADP [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ADP\", \"ADP(3-)\", \"Adenosine 5'-diphosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10470878], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29370\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29370.6\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10470878], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29372, \"displayName\": \"Pi [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Pi\", \"hydrogenphosphate\", \"Orthophosphate\", \"Phosphate\", \"Inorganic Phosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10470878], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29372\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29372.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10470874, \"displayName\": \"3,7,24THCA is conjugated with Coenzyme A (SLC27A2 VLCS)\", \"followingEvent\": [10470878], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"3,7,24THCA is conjugated with Coenzyme A (SLC27A2 VLCS)\", \"3,7,24THCA + ATP + CoASH => 3,7,24THCA-CoA + AMP + pyrophosphate + H2O (SLC27A2 \\\"VLCS\\\")\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-193743\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-193743.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10470868, \"displayName\": \"3,7,24THCA is conjugated with Coenzyme A (SLC27A5 BACS)\", \"followingEvent\": [10470878], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"3,7,24THCA is conjugated with Coenzyme A (SLC27A5 BACS)\", \"3,7,24THCA + ATP + CoASH => 3,7,24THCA-CoA + AMP + pyrophosphate + H2O (SCLS25A5 \\\"BACS\\\")\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-193711\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-193711.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"SSC\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 49633, \"displayName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"name\": [\"Sus scrofa\", \"pig\", \"swine\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9823\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-193753\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-193753.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\"}]}"
