        "@value": "PTGS1 dimer [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + PTGS2 dimer [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + PTGS inhibitors [cytosol] => PTGS2 dimer:PTGS inhibitors [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + PTGS1 dimer:PTGS Inhibitors [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]"
