        "@value": "H+ [cytosol] + CHOL [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + NADPH [cytosol] + O2 [cytosol] => H2O [cytosol] + NADP+ [cytosol] + 7 alpha-hydroxycholesterol [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]"
