one\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-193064\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-193064.1\"}], \"regulatedBy\": [{\"className\": \"PositiveRegulation\", \"dbId\": 10470592, \"displayName\": \"Positive regulation by 'POMC(138-176) [cytosol]'\", \"regulatedEntity\": [10554393], \"schemaClass\": \"PositiveRegulation\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"SSC\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 49633, \"displayName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"name\": [\"Sus scrofa\", \"pig\", \"swine\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9823\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-9705714\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-9705714.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a ma