lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"AA\", \"arachidonate\", \"Arachidonate\", \"arachidonic acid\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-140356\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-140356.6\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Arachidonate is oxidised to PGG2 by PTGS2\", \"(5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate + 2 O2 => prostaglandin G2\", \"Arachidonate oxidised to PGG2\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 140357, \"displayName\": \"PGG2 [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PGG2\", \"prostaglandin G2(1-)\", \"prostaglandin G2\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10509879], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-140357\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-140357.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10461417, \"displayName\": \"PLA2G4A (cPLA2) hydrolyzes phosphatidylcholine\", \"followingEvent\": [10509879], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PLA2G4A (cPLA2) hydrolyzes phosphatidylcholine\", \"1-acyl-2-(5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z-eicosatetraenoyl)-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine + H2O => (5Z,8Z,11Z,14Z)-eicosatetraenoate + a 1-acyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine + H+\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-111883\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-111883.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"SSC\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 49633, \"displayName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"name\": [\"Sus scrofa\", \"pig\", \"swine\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9823\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-2309787\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-2309787.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\"}]}"
