6 to 14(S)-HDPAn-6\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9025960, \"displayName\": \"14(S)-HDPAn-6 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"14(S)-HDPAn-6\", \"(4Z,7Z,10Z,12E,14S,16Z)-14-hydroxydocosapentaenoate\", \"14(S)-HDPAn-6(1-)\", \"(4Z,7Z,10Z,12E,14S,16Z)-14-hydroxydocosapentaenoic acid\", \"14(S)-hydroxy-omega-6-docosapentaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10551185], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9025960\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9025960.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"SSC\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 49633, \"displayName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"name\": [\"Sus scrofa\", \"pig\", \"swine\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9823\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-9025957\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-9025957.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. 