"O2\", \"dioxygen\", \"Oxygen\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29368\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29368.6\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10470609], \"dbId\": 29364, \"displayName\": \"NADPH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADPH\", \"NADPH(4-)\", \"TPNH\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29364\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29364.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10470609], \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CYP17A1 cleaves 17aHPROG to ANDST\", \"Side chain cleavage of 17alpha-hydroxyprogesterone to form 4-Androstene-3, 17-dione\", \"17alpha-hydroxyprogesterone + NADPH + H+ + O2 => 4-Androstene-3, 17-dione + NADP+ + H2O + acetaldehyde\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 193079, \"displayName\": \"ANDST [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ANDST\", \"androst-4-ene-3,17-dione\", \"4-Androstene-3, 17-dione\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10470609], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-193079\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-193079.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29366, \"displayName\": \"NADP+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADP+\", \"NADP(3-)\", \"NADP\", \"NADP(+)\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"beta-Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10470609], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceM