", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1524038.4\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ACAA2 tetramer transfers acyl group from Ac-CoA to acyl-CoA forming 3OA-CoA and CoA-SH\", \"an acyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA => a 3-oxoacyl-CoA + CoA\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 8874749, \"displayName\": \"3OA-CoA [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"3OA-CoA\", \"3-oxo-fatty acyl-CoA(4-)\", \"3-oxoacyl-CoA\", \"3-oxo-fatty acyl-CoA\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10543933], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-8874749\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-8874749.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29374, \"displayName\": \"CoA-SH [mitochondrial matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CoA-SH\", \"coenzyme A(4-)\", \"CoA\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10543933], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29374\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29374.5\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"SSC\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 49633, \"displayName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"name\": [\"Sus scrofa\", \"pig\", \"swine\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"9823\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-8874745\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-8874745.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for 