ic reticulum membrane]\", \"endCoordinate\": 534, \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"LPCAT1\", \"LPCAT1\", \"F1S029\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceGeneProduct\", \"schemaClass\": \"EntityWithAccessionedSequence\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-1498772\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-1498772.1\", \"startCoordinate\": 1}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10543778], \"dbId\": 426925, \"displayName\": \"PC [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PC\", \"1,2-diacyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine\", \"Phosphatidyl choline\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-426925\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-426925.5\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"STARD10 binds LPCAT1 and PC\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Complex\", \"dbId\": 10543761, \"displayName\": \"STARD10:LPCAT1:PC [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"STARD10:LPCAT1:PC\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10543778], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-8873921\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-8873921.1\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10499184, \"displayName\": \"1-acyl LPC is acylated to PC by LPCAT\", \"followingEvent\": [10543778], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"1-acyl LPC is acylated to PC by LPCAT\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Sus scrofa\", \"stId\": \"R-SSC-1482547\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-SSC-1482547.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10499158, \"displayName\": \"2-acyl LPC is acylated to PC by LPCAT\", \"followingEvent\": [10543778], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-acyl LPC is 