matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"VLCFA\", \"very long-chain fatty acid anion\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9914044\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9914044.1\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SLC27A2-mediated ligation of peroxisomal fatty acid and CoASH\", \"a very long-chain fatty acid + ATP + CoA => a very long-chain fatty acyl-CoA + AMP + diphosphate\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 389620, \"displayName\": \"AMP [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"AMP\", \"adenosine 5'-monophosphate(2-)\", \"adenosine 5'-monophosphate\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10560176], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-389620\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-389620.6\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 389593, \"displayName\": \"PPi [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"PPi\", \"diphosphate(3-)\", \"Pyrophosphate\", \"diphosphoric acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10560176], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-389593\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-389593.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9914131, \"displayName\": \"VLCFA-CoA [peroxisomal matrix]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"VLCFA-CoA\", \"very long-chain fatty acyl-CoA(4-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10560176], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9914131\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9914131.1\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10481445, \"displayName\": \"Peroxisomal uptake of very long-chain fatty acyl CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [10560176], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\"